        {
          "text": "Nai abu Moses alokiŋaren Ekapolon kiŋit iŋes tema, “Ikwapei ayenia ayoŋ atemar nyerworo ayoŋ ejok, alipite nai epupokinia Parao ŋakiro kaŋ?”",
